# Sprint: Fix Catalogue Navigation + Verify Products Data Path

## Overview
**Scope**: Homepage catalogue navigation → Products page data output only. Products page UI is pre-skeleton (legacy), will be redone later. Focus is on:
1. **Catalogue navigation** - Architecture, design system, performance
2. **Data path verification** - URL → resolveSlugToId → unrollDescendantKeys → getSelectedProducts
3. **Products output** - Verify correct products returned (skeletal UI acceptable)

**Current State**: 
- **CRITICAL**: DetailSection.tsx uses `<a>` not `Link` (full page reloads)
- URL generation correct: `/products/headphones/open-back`
- Data path functional but needs verification
- Products page returns products but UI is legacy/pre-skeleton

**Target State**:
- DetailSection uses Next.js `Link` for client-side navigation
- Data path verified: all 22 catalogue items → correct products
- Console logging of products for verification
- Zero regression in homepage

---

## End-to-End Data Path Analysis

```
User Clicks "Open-Back" in Headphones Section
    ↓
DetailSection.tsx (line 43: <a href="/products/headphones/open-back">)
    ↓
Full page reload (BUG - should be client-side)
    ↓
[...category]/page.tsx catches route
    ↓
resolveSlugToId("headphones/open-back") → "o7c6baiuobsr7ni2y2vf22sh"
    ↓
unrollDescendantKeys(id) → ["o7c6baiuobsr7ni2y2vf22sh", ...children]
    ↓
getSelectedProducts(catalogueKeys) → { products, totalProductsCount }
    ↓
ProductsGrid displays (legacy UI, acceptable for now)
```

### Architecture Checklist

| Checkpoint | Status | Notes |
|------------|--------|-------|
| Server Component default | ✅ | CatalogueNavbar is async Server Component |
| Parallel data fetching | ✅ | `Promise.all([getSelectedProducts(), ...])` |
| URL generation | ✅ | `/products/${root}/${leaf}` format correct |
| VFS resolution | ✅ | `resolveSlugToId` uses slugToIdMap |
| Descendant unrolling | ✅ | `unrollDescendantKeys` returns all category IDs |
| Product query | ✅ | `getSelectedProducts` accepts catalogueKeys array |

### Design System Checklist

| Checkpoint | Status | Notes |
|------------|--------|-------|
| Tailwind tokens | ✅ | DetailSection uses `text-brand-400`, `text-secondary-300` |
| Responsive breakpoints | ✅ | `xs:`, `sm:`, `landscape:`, `lg-desktop:` used |
| Hover states | ✅ | `hover:text-brand-200`, `active:text-brand-400` |
| **Link component** | ❌ | Uses `<a>` not `Link` - **CRITICAL BUG** |

### Performance Checklist

| Checkpoint | Status | Notes |
|------------|--------|-------|
| Client-side navigation | ❌ | Full page reload on every click |
| Prefetching | ❌ | No Link prefetching available |
| Data caching | ✅ | Sanity fetch likely cached |
| Parallel fetching | ✅ | Products + filters + sortables in parallel |

---

## Scope Contract 1: Fix Navigation (DetailSection.tsx)

**Objective**: Replace `<a>` with `Link` for client-side navigation.

**Files to Modify**:
- `app/components/layout/catalogue/details/DetailSection.tsx`

**DoD - Layer 1 (Structure)**:
- [ ] Import `Link` from "next/link"
- [ ] Replace `<a>` with `<Link>`
- [ ] Keep `href={link.url}` unchanged
- [ ] Keep all existing className props

**DoD - Layer 2 (Layout)**:
- [ ] No visual changes
- [ ] Staggered animations preserved via CSS custom properties
- [ ] Group data attributes preserved for animation

**DoD - Layer 3 (Surface)**:
- [ ] Typography unchanged (text-body)
- [ ] Colors unchanged (text-secondary-300, hover:text-brand-200)
- [ ] Transitions preserved

**DoD - Layer 4 (Interaction)**:
- [ ] Client-side navigation (no page reload)
- [ ] Hover states work
- [ ] Keyboard navigation works
- [ ] Prefetching enabled

**Verification**:
- [ ] E2E test: Click catalogue item → no full page reload
- [ ] E2E test: Network tab shows no document requests
- [ ] E2E test: Back button works
- [ ] Manual: Navigation feels instant

