## Scope Contract 2: Verify Data Path (All 22 Categories)

**Objective**: Verify clicking any catalogue item returns correct products.

**Files to Verify**:
- `data/catalogue.ts` - URL generation
- `app/(store)/products/[...category]/page.tsx` - Data resolution
- `sanity/lib/products/getSelectedProducts.ts` - Product query

**DoD - Layer 1 (Structure)**:
- [ ] All 22 leaf categories have correct URL format
- [ ] `resolveSlugToId` returns valid ID for each slug
- [ ] `unrollDescendantKeys` returns keys for each resolved ID
- [ ] `getSelectedProducts` returns products for each key set

**DoD - Layer 2 (Layout)**:
- [ ] Console logging shows category → ID resolution
- [ ] Console logging shows descendant keys count
- [ ] Console logging shows product count per category
- [ ] Error handling for missing categories

**DoD - Layer 3 (Surface)**:
- [ ] Console format: "[Category Path] → [ID] → [X] keys → [Y] products"
- [ ] Clear error messages for resolution failures
- [ ] Summary table of all 22 categories

**DoD - Layer 4 (Interaction)**:
- [ ] Only logs in development
- [ ] Zero impact on production
- [ ] <5ms overhead

**Verification**:
- [ ] Script: Test all 22 category paths resolve correctly
- [ ] Script: Test product counts >0 for each category
- [ ] E2E test: /products/headphones/open-back returns headphones
- [ ] E2E test: /products/audio-electronics/desktop-amps returns amps
- [ ] E2E test: /products/accessories/earpads returns earpads

