## Scope Contract 4: Regression Test Suite

**Objective**: Ensure zero regression in homepage catalogue navigation.

**Files to Create**:
- `tests/catalogue/navigation.regression.test.ts`
- `tests-e2e/catalogue-navigation.spec.ts`

**DoD - Layer 1 (Structure)**:
- [ ] Mock catalogue data with all 3 root categories
- [ ] Mock leaf nodes (22 total)
- [ ] Mock products for each leaf
- [ ] Test file structure follows existing patterns

**DoD - Layer 2 (Layout)**:
- [ ] Unit test: Link component renders correctly
- [ ] Unit test: URL generation produces correct paths
- [ ] E2E test: Click each root → dropdown opens
- [ ] E2E test: Click each leaf → navigation occurs

**DoD - Layer 3 (Surface)**:
- [ ] Test names descriptive
- [ ] Screenshot on failure
- [ ] Descriptive error messages

**DoD - Layer 4 (Interaction)**:
- [ ] Tests run in <30 seconds
- [ ] Deterministic
- [ ] Parallel execution

**Verification**:
- [ ] Run: `npm test -- tests/catalogue/navigation.regression.test.ts` - passes
- [ ] Run: `npx playwright test tests-e2e/catalogue-navigation.spec.ts` - passes
- [ ] Run: `npm run test:all` - all existing tests pass

