## Sprint Execution Sequence

**Phase 1: Safety First (Day 1)**
1. Write regression tests (Scope Contract 4, Layers 1-2)
2. Fix DetailSection.tsx `<a>` → `Link` (Scope Contract 1)
3. Run E2E tests - verify navigation works
4. Manual test: Verify all 22 categories navigate correctly

**Phase 2: Data Path Verification (Day 2)**
5. Add console logging to [...category]/page.tsx (Scope Contract 3)
6. Test all 22 categories manually, verify products returned
7. Document any categories with 0 products or wrong products
8. Verify data path end-to-end

**Phase 3: Final Verification (Day 3)**
9. Full regression test run
10. Performance check: Navigation should be instant
11. Manual QA: Click every catalogue item
12. Document results

---

## Success Criteria

**Functional**:
- [ ] Clicking any catalogue item uses client-side navigation
- [ ] All 22 category paths navigate correctly
- [ ] Console shows products for each category
- [ ] Products match category context (manual verification)

**Performance**:
- [ ] Navigation time <100ms (was ~500-1000ms)
- [ ] Prefetching works
- [ ] Zero jank/flash on navigation

**Quality**:
- [ ] All regression tests pass
- [ ] All existing tests pass
- [ ] No TypeScript errors
- [ ] No ESLint warnings

