## Out of Scope (Products Page UI)

The following are **explicitly out of scope** - products page is pre-skeleton:
- SidebarClient styling (hardcoded colors acceptable for now)
- ProductsGrid layout/ styling
- Filter/sort UI quality
- Mobile responsive design of products page
- Any products page component refactoring

**Only requirement**: Products page must output correct products for verification.

---

## Rollback Plan

If navigation breaks:
1. Revert DetailSection.tsx to `<a>` temporarily
2. Debug Link implementation
3. Re-apply fix

---

